-- Same SIF as the OOD "RStudio (bioconductor)" option "R 4.6.1 / Bioconductor 3.23".
local sif    = "/apps/biocontainers/images/r-bioconductor_3.23-R-4.6.1.sif"
local extras = "/apps/biocontainers/extras/r-package-site-library/3.23-R-4.6.1"

help([==[

Description
===========
R 4.6.1 with Bioconductor 3.23 in an Apptainer image (3.23-R-4.6.1).
Includes tidyverse, common Bioconductor packages, TeX, Quarto and RStudio Desktop.
This is the same image as the "RStudio (bioconductor)" app in Open OnDemand.

Commands
========
  R, Rscript, quarto   run inside the container
  rstudio              RStudio Desktop (use in a ThinLinc session)

Example:
  module load r-bioconductor/3.23-R-4.6.1
  Rscript -e 'library(DESeq2); sessionInfo()'

Package libraries (first match wins)
====================================
  1. ~/R/x86_64-pc-linux-gnu-library/<x.y>   your own installs (install.packages / BiocManager::install)
  2. RCAC extras library for this release   (read-only, maintained by RCAC)
  3. packages built into the image

List image contents:  apptainer exec ]==] .. sif .. [==[ cat /rcac/MANIFEST.txt

More information
================
 - Home page: https://www.r-project.org/
 - Home page: https://www.bioconductor.org/
 - Home page: https://posit.co/products/open-source/rstudio/
